{"name":"Meditative","hex":"#96aab0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"meditative","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of or pertaining to meditation.","Thoughtful; pensive."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/meditative"}],"entries":[{"title":"Meditation","blocks":[{"text":"Meditation is a practice in which an individual uses a technique or combination of techniques to train attention and awareness and detach from \"discursive, ruminating thought\", achieving a mentally clear and emotionally calm and stable state, while not intending to analyze the effects, to judge its outcomes, or to create any expectation with regard to the process."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meditation","wikidata":"Q108458"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Swami_Vivekananda_1896.jpg/120px-Swami_Vivekananda_1896.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/Swami_Vivekananda_1896.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Swami_Vivekananda_1896.jpg/120px-Swami_Vivekananda_1896.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASwami_Vivekananda_1896.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Hsuan_Hua_Hong_Kong_1.jpeg/330px-Hsuan_Hua_Hong_Kong_1.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Hsuan_Hua_Hong_Kong_1.jpeg/330px-Hsuan_Hua_Hong_Kong_1.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHsuan_Hua_Hong_Kong_1.jpeg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Baduanjin_qigong_edit1.jpg/